# Firebase-specific Python dependencies for the Cloud Function wrapper.
# `scripts/deploy_backend.sh` concatenates this file with
# `backend/requirements.txt` to produce `firebase/requirements.txt` at deploy
# time, so backend deps stay a single source of truth in backend/.
